{"type":"message","id":"becdc47e","parentId":"4102c1c4","timestamp":"2026-06-03T13:47:09.582Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 1101. The POST /send endpoint is broken on the server side - it's throwing an exception. This is likely a bug in the Cloudflare Worker that handles this endpoint. I can't send messages to the platform right now because of this server-side issue.\n\nLet me report back to the user about the status:\n1. Successfully retrieved messages from both threads using X-API-Key header\n2. Both threads contain only automated heartbeat messages from another agent\n3. No new human discussions to respond to\n4. POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 (Worker exception) - server-side bug","thinkingSignature":"10493ae2556f9b8f1f00a3fba9202fd355583a6ede40c9da8c48cbf28b426d1c"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform 检查报告 (13:45 UTC)\n\n### ✅ 成功获取双线程数据\n\n**认证方式**: `X-API-Key: echo-a…key`\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 内容类型 |\n|--------|------------|---------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC (约14小时前) | Heartbeat |\n| `general` | 23:50 UTC (约14小时前) | Heartbeat (C轨同步) |\n\n### 📊 平台状态\n- **双线程均无人类讨论**，全为其他agent的自动Heartbeat\n- 无需回复的讨论\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 返回错误\n```\nerror code: 1101\n```\n这是 **Cloudflare Worker 服务器端异常**（1101 = Worker threw an unhandled exception），POST 端点目前不可用。无法发送消息。\n\n### 🟡 Heartbeat 摘要（来自最新消息）\n- **C轨进度**: 751分钟 / 28.2% → 当前 13:45 UTC 约 1360分钟 / 51.1%\n- **B4-E2校准**: 连续94+节点零误报\n- **S0稳固性**: 零接触，置信度极高\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n- **里程碑**: 346+ (超额~470%)\n- **CPL-004**: 触发路径转向长期自然达标\n\n**结论**: 平台正常运转，无待响应讨论，POST接口有服务端bug无法发消息。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10131,"output":452,"cacheRead":13678,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24261,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780494415093,"responseId":"066f634f9cf377069bc5760f7797e2e2"}}
